 "lyrics": [
  {
   "start": 17.61,
   "end": 20.6,
   "text": "Lay awake at night"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.6,
   "end": 23.02,
   "text": "Wondering how could I"
  },
  {
   "start": 23.02,
   "end": 27.62,
   "text": "let it get this way"
  },
  {
   "start": 27.62,
   "end": 29.88,
   "text": "Through all the pain"
  },
  {
   "start": 29.88,
   "end": 31.95,
   "text": "I took all the blame"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.95,
   "end": 36.22,
   "text": "While you cursed my last name"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.22,
   "end": 38.68,
   "text": "I thought we could get better"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.68,
   "end": 41.2,
   "text": "Stay committed like a soldier"
  },
  {
   "start": 41.2,
   "end": 44.36,
   "text": "Believed we're okay"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.36,
   "end": 53.26,
   "text": "Now I know that you don't care at all"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.26,
   "end": 56.08,
   "text": "Time wasted"
  },
  {
   "start": 56.08,
   "end": 62.66,
   "text": "Gave all of my soul and my heart to someone that would never"
  },
  {
   "start": 60.87,
   "end": 62.9,
   "text": "Give me the same"
  },
  {
   "start": 62.66,
   "end": 70.93,
   "text": "I was a fool to believe that you would finally be the one to"
  },
  {
   "start": 70.25,
   "end": 72.14,
   "text": "Give me the same"
  },
  {
   "start": 71.13,
   "end": 75.56,
   "text": "Heartbroken now"
  },
  {
   "start": 75.56,
   "end": 79.48,
   "text": "How you let me down"
  },
  {
   "start": 79.48,
   "end": 82.8,
   "text": "But somehow"
  },
  {
   "start": 82.8,
   "end": 89.2,
   "text": "Deep down I still do love you"
  },
  {
   "start": 91.61,
   "end": 94.64,
   "text": "Now you're up all night"
  },
  {
   "start": 94.64,
   "end": 96.65,
   "text": "Telling your lies"
  },
  {
   "start": 96.65,
   "end": 98.48,
   "text": "About the way I hurt you"
  },
  {
   "start": 98.48,
   "end": 100.89,
   "text": "They couldn't see the way"
  },
  {
   "start": 100.89,
   "end": 103.56,
   "text": "You made me feel ashamed"
  },
  {
   "start": 103.56,
   "end": 107.63,
   "text": "For choosing to love you"
  },
  {
   "start": 107.63,
   "end": 110.37,
   "text": "I began to see clearer"
  },
  {
   "start": 110.37,
   "end": 112.92,
   "text": "That you were just a liar"
  },
  {
   "start": 112.92,
   "end": 115.65,
   "text": "Stuck in your ways"
  },
  {
   "start": 115.65,
   "end": 124.8,
   "text": "So now I choose to walk away forever"
  },
  {
   "start": 124.8,
   "end": 127.64,
   "text": "Time wasted"
  },
  {
   "start": 127.64,
   "end": 134.56,
